  <item>
    <title>E06 不关灯的便利店、午夜唐吉诃德，在日本体会零售奥义</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dc5c67ee04007d88d72105</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dc5c67ee04007d88d72105</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Sep 2024 14:00:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>日本，作为东亚商业世界极具特色的一面旗帜，深刻影响了我们的零售业态、消费习惯、文化潮流。遍布上海街头的便利店业态，从日本演化繁荣，市值50亿美金的新零售代表名创优品，受到折扣零售商大创（Daiso）和唐吉诃德（Don Quijote）的理念浸润。实地探访，感受日本零售业态的终极奥义。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 箱根之行，感受箱根驿传百年历史</span></p><span></span><p><span>图1：美丽宁静的箱根</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhOSb_fHUbfc4VGiL5GJ0sNMtzyU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvAI74ZHrBEY0O0sbVOHLfTVGBFQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图2：缆车、登山电车、便利的交通网</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpRCW4JEkHfSljfkm9aFUGM2PE7J.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqcBAa5Z9EbQMNnn9klp3A3Z4Ubi.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhPxO5wSI4eGeQ9TQjgCyM0WrEww.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 透过7-Eleven发展历程，理解日本便利店业态的兴起</span></p><span></span><p><span>图3：新宿、原宿、涩谷街头</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqFmirK-gzLkUoCuK_uZQ3QE9KBK.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljQIki2TcG8njIeOGVFz0VV5miXV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmpV_G87KMplJhyQ_KxD4GVi3vpR.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnwdxlGNrPmdGbwycAHW6RqZ2nFD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> 7-Eleven如何解决便利店业态面临的三大问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>图4： 7-Eleven便利店中的银行、便当</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv9ZkYzoUh4LFwej1IjsXtr0MCRv.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fufvn5PscoU4g3aM0u4ekuxUMl-k.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 掌握情绪价值，唐吉诃德作为日本零售业态的另一面旗帜</span></p><span></span><p><span>图5：唐吉诃德招牌、店内商品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lon9UVn291Kr1ptd97wwkd9bgEsA.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lng3C0YecXarNkG55VBTicoKbFPw.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqlUhME0s1GUYfQHFG07EnGjy7tW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> 重视细节，藏在日本企业中的文化属性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1937">32:17</a> 借鉴日本，寻找新的机会</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljwuh6R2VS8OVMi89n5jOVHaFxZf.m4a" length="34871021" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvvlsJ2LUVq6YTKhJtZuVOUZoCgm.jpg"/>
