  <item>
    <title>E05 探寻韩国时尚产业，感受首尔青年的活力与彷徨</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d31da35a91beebb3d1c99e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d31da35a91beebb3d1c99e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Aug 2024 13:41:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>韩国，从地缘政治与历史的角度出发，可以被列为最不幸的国家之一，强邻环伺，历史屈辱，战争阴云笼罩，时刻无法摆脱大国角力场的命运。然而，夹缝中艰难求索，在朴正熙的领导下韩国民众创造了举世瞩目的“汉江奇迹”，也培育了与其国土面积和政治地位并不协调的荣誉感与自尊心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为大韩民国的首都，首尔同样拥有着迷人的矛盾气质，屹立于过去与现实之间，捍卫着传统，创造着潮流。请跟随主播一起，跨越黄海，穿越韩流，走近精致的韩男韩女，探寻纷繁的时尚业态，发现一个充满商机活力充沛的首尔。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 小轶初探韩国，主要评价竟是破败</span></p><span></span><p><span>图1：DMZ三八线非军事区</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsvh9U6EXSCH9TbUB5lAMpTJ-Xt8.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图2：弘大夜市</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmBuPf7Nq-BuNWNZZvV5_97ASp0m.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图3：时尚潮牌遍布的汉南洞街道</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lum5WMOE0lpan80pXv89FjEcTxxf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 首尔年轻人令人惊叹的形象管理</span></p><span></span><p><span>图4：遍布大街小巷的自拍馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luNR6ITKEIjfyBdMWQlX1vIgmulJ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 形象管理与首饰、服装商业业态</span></p><span></span><p><span>图5：装潢个性的潮牌店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lppypHKE8LnExW0ka3z5SQt9_mRr.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvD-zYx36ThJE0yjIyXvB0txWIcz.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loE_ZmW8XqpU8ZCOzJIRRDoCI5KA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图6 ：耳饰集合店NYUNYU和酷似梵克雅宝的设计</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljYlJr7cFe08XoVjAQ2NUPMc10_v.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj5c2GK7yQYK0v7M6H-RLa4D3BaP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">20:31</a> 韩国的男性护肤、彩妆市场已颇具规模</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">26:52</a> 高度内卷后的自我关注，美丽背后的心酸与无奈</span></p><span></span><p><span>图7：路边KTV</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhwfEIzGNUOipusPDFy08oerFM7v.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqvkTa9jeiXtQIZ-YtG3AJk03zMm.m4a" length="30198323" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvvlsJ2LUVq6YTKhJtZuVOUZoCgm.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E04 中年裁员：员工终将面对的《逆行人生》，企业穿越周期的灵丹妙药？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c0cad033591c27becd8fe0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c0cad033591c27becd8fe0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Aug 2024 16:07:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>近期热映的《逆行人生》讲述了作为家人骄傲的985名校毕业生，面对生活重担和中年裁员，以外卖重启人生，引发社会讨论。对于以科技、金融行业等新时代的人力密集型企业来说，人工成本是利润表成本结构中最重要的部分。在业绩承压时，裁员通常被看做是企业短期降本增利的高效手段。但从长期来看是企业穿越周期的灵丹妙药么？对于个人来说，当中年裁员面对逆行人生，又将如何衡量自己的价值，将以何种心态来应对，在经济的浪潮中如何自处，是每个人面临的哲学问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:00:23</a> 近期热映《逆行人生》讲述中年裁员的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">00:01:34</a> 从各行业利润表成本结构看企业裁员的动因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">00:08:22</a> 从长期来看，裁员对于企业来说是更经济的选择么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">00:17:50</a> 商品经济下，人和企业的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">00:21:29</a> 布里丹之驴，裁员作为随机因素帮助我们决策</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">00:25:58</a> 世界充满随机性，裁员也是随机事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">00:29:11</a> 随机性，存在主义，西西弗斯的石头，个人如何看待自己的一生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2094">00:34:54</a> 如果被裁，送外卖也要走出个虎虎生风</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关书单：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《随机漫步的傻瓜》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgj7Z_Wd9EbsJemfvdP2_9-wqHvC.m4a" length="34897987" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvvlsJ2LUVq6YTKhJtZuVOUZoCgm.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E03 一千块钱投资能做什么生意？上海滩摆摊儿指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b78f8edb5e6d6bf9599f0a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b78f8edb5e6d6bf9599f0a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Aug 2024 16:04:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>普通人低成本创业从多低开始？一千块的投资能做什么生意？摆摊儿如何选项目？实操中又有哪些坑？没有调查就没有发言权，播主深入市场，还原摆摊儿真实收益。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> 没什么资本能做什么生意？开局一个碗，开启摆摊生意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 摆摊儿如何选项目，也有方法论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 网红游戏穿越火线</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjX2NXzAW0cLwq7U1gwPuEwExPnd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft8G_F-5Jdsaw_n3tBwema2QhnX5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> 拆解财务报表，靠天吃饭的收益波动性</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flzllxiyk5i3he0Lrmn7SwQLaBwC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> 麻雀虽小五脏俱全，再小的市场也有江湖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a> 摆摊儿不失为低成本验证商业模式的一种高效方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1551">25:51</a> 回归商业本质，流量的自然选择</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lluFQbodzsg4Tt9KyEg88DwZ7u0Z.m4a" length="32791272" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvvlsJ2LUVq6YTKhJtZuVOUZoCgm.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
